@host = https://localhost:55076

### Forberedelse: opret elev til spærringstest
# Kør kun én gang. Anden gang giver 400, fordi brugernavnet findes.
POST {{host}}/api/students
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "spaerretest",
  "password": "hemmelig1",
  "parentEmail": "test@example.com",
  "grade": 8,
  "interestIds": [1]
}

### AK4.1 Login — forventet 200 + token
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "logintest",
  "password": "hemmelig1"
}

### AK4.2 Forkert kodeord — forventet 401 "Invalid username or password."
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "logintest",
  "password": "forkert"
}

### AK4.3 Ukendt brugernavn — forventet 401, SAMME besked som AK4.2
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "findesikke",
  "password": "hemmelig1"
}

### AK4.4 Spærring — send 5 gange — forventet 401 hver gang
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "spaerretest",
  "password": "forkert"
}

### AK4.5 Spærret profil, rigtigt kodeord — forventet 401, SAMME besked som AK4.2
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "spaerretest",
  "password": "hemmelig1"
}

### AK4.6 Efter 5 minutter, rigtigt kodeord — forventet 200 + token
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "spaerretest",
  "password": "hemmelig1"
}

### Validering: tomt brugernavn — forventet 400
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "",
  "password": "hemmelig1"
}